Error: Jet.ImpureCallInPureContext: `relay` reaches a write of module state `pinned`
  --> Tests/UI/Effects/pure_fn_writing_module_state_is_e3401.jet:19:13
    |
 19 | inc: fn() { pinned += 1 }
    |             ^^^^^^
 Why: relay → inc writes `pinned`, which outlives the call — the whole call chain must be pure inside `relay`
 Fix: Move the write out of `inc`, or drop the `-[]>` bound from `relay` so its effects are inferred
